### 发布商品
POST http://localhost:8080/api/goods
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId": 2110255801544339458, "title": "iPad 9代 95新", "price": 1899.00, "description": "自用一年，无划痕"}

### 商品分页（第1页每页5条）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/goods?pageNum=1&pageSize=5

### 某用户发布的在售商品（userId 换成你库里的）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/goods/user/2110255801544339458

### 下单
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"goodsId": 替换, "buyerId": 替换, "sellerId": 替换, "amount": 1899.00}

### 取消订单
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/orders/替换订单id/cancel

### 订单分页
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders?pageNum=1&pageSize=5